{
  "info": {
    "name": "banking-api",
    "description": "API Sistema Bancario — Sofka\n\n**Antes de probar:** API en `http://localhost:8080` (`docker compose up`) y BD con datos del PDF:\n```powershell\nGet-Content src\\main\\resources\\BaseDatos.sql -Raw | docker exec -i banking-sqlserver /opt/mssql-tools18/bin/sqlcmd -S localhost -U sa -P \"Banking@2024\" -C\n```\n\n**Orden recomendado:** carpeta `01 - Solo lectura` → `02 - Movimientos y reporte` → `03 - CRUD (altera BD)`.\n\nSi ejecutas DELETE de cliente/cuenta id 1 y luego más requests, fallarán con **404** (borrado lógico). El reporte del PDF usa fechas **2022-02** y `clienteId=2` (Marianela), no 2024.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080/api"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Solo lectura (BD limpia)",
      "description": "Ejecutar primero. No modifica datos.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar clientes (3 del PDF)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/clientes"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener cliente Jose (id 1)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/clientes/1"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar cuentas (4 del PDF)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/cuentas"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener cuenta 478758 (id 1, saldo 1425)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/cuentas/1"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar movimientos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/movimientos"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener movimiento id 1",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/movimientos/1"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reporte Marianela Feb 2022 (caso PDF)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reportes?fechaInicio=2022-02-01&fechaFin=2022-02-28&clienteId=2",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["reportes"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "fechaInicio", "value": "2022-02-01" },
                { "key": "fechaFin", "value": "2022-02-28" },
                { "key": "clienteId", "value": "2" }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Movimientos y reporte",
      "description": "Requiere BD limpia. Retiro en cuenta 1; saldo insuficiente en cuenta 4 (saldo 0).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar retiro cuenta 1 (-500, saldo queda 925)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cuentaId\": 1,\n  \"valor\": -500\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/movimientos"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Retiro saldo insuficiente cuenta 4 (400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cuentaId\": 4,\n  \"valor\": -100\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/movimientos"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reporte Jose Feb 2022 (movimiento id 1)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reportes?fechaInicio=2022-02-01&fechaFin=2022-02-28&clienteId=1",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["reportes"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "fechaInicio", "value": "2022-02-01" },
                { "key": "fechaFin", "value": "2022-02-28" },
                { "key": "clienteId", "value": "1" }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 - CRUD (altera BD, ejecutar al final)",
      "description": "Después de estas pruebas, vuelve a cargar BaseDatos.sql para repetir desde cero.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Clientes",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Crear cliente nuevo",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Cliente Prueba Postman\",\n  \"genero\": \"M\",\n  \"edad\": 30,\n  \"identificacion\": \"ID-POSTMAN-UNICO\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Quito\",\n  \"telefono\": \"0999999999\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"1234\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/clientes"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Actualizar cliente id 3 (Juan)",
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Juan Osorio\",\n  \"genero\": \"M\",\n  \"edad\": 40,\n  \"identificacion\": \"ID-JUAN-003\",\n  \"direccion\": \"13 junio y Equinoccial\",\n  \"telefono\": \"098874587\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"1245\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/clientes/3"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Eliminar cliente id 3 (lógico, 204)",
              "request": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/clientes/3"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Cuentas",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Crear cuenta para Jose (cliente 1)",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"numeroCuenta\": \"999001\",\n  \"tipoCuenta\": \"Ahorro\",\n  \"saldoInicial\": 1500.00,\n  \"clienteId\": 1\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/cuentas"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Actualizar cuenta id 2",
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"numeroCuenta\": \"225487\",\n  \"tipoCuenta\": \"Corriente\",\n  \"saldoInicial\": 100.00,\n  \"saldoDisponible\": 700.00,\n  \"clienteId\": 2\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/cuentas/2"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Eliminar cuenta id 4 (lógico, 204)",
              "request": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/cuentas/4"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
